## Verification

- `cargo test` — the rewritten + new `tests/xpbd_coupling.rs` gates pass (mobilization, no-fluidization, grind-ordering, conservation, dissipation, buoyancy); `tests/xpbd_bed.rs` (dry + saturated-static settling) and `tests/xpbd_statics.rs` (spacing-invariance) pass; suite green except the 3 documented pre-existing reds.
- Native visual — `SCENE=v60pour cargo run --release --example water_app`: fine water threads the coarser bed; the pour visibly rearranges the surface at the impingement point; the bed drains and does not churn/suspend.
- Web — `wasm-pack build --target web --out-dir www/pkg`, hard-refresh: same behavior in-browser (verify Tint compiles the new WGSL; no new console errors; ≤ 8 storage buffers per stage).
- Process — given the scope, run multiple `/deliberate` (Codex, gpt-5.5 high) rounds on this plan before execution, folding each REVISE.

